GitLab Knowledge Graph CLI

Usage: gkg <COMMAND>

Commands:
  index   Index repositories in a workspace
  server  Manage the gkg server
  remove  Remove a workspace or project from the knowledge graph
  clean   Remove all indexed data
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version  Print version
